-- ccc9-tests-records.l4 -- tests for ss 278.1 to 278.31. Expected values are written by hand from the text (line numbers of the text file where cited).


-- Fixtures for the seam input s 787(1) (text line 16717): a fine of not more than $5,000 or imprisonment of not more than two years less a day, or both.
`s 278 test: the s 787(1) general penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` 5000), `no fine is stated`

§ `s 278.1: definitions (lines 5303-5306)`

